IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `macma-requests`

-- Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act 2000, ss 2, 10, 11, 16, 20, 21, 21A, 22, 25, 26, 28, 35 and 40 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_mutual-assistance-in-criminal-matters-act-2000.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

